{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/4ab13e5e30cea0dfdabab0dc21254a28.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span>Final Stardust is a return to basics for Collectible Card Games! It's built around fast-paced, five minute battles thanks to streamlined, easily understandable gameplay. Thanks to instant effects and positioning your monsters - or Planos - it's all about how you play the hand you draw, rather than mastery of meta and min-maxing your deck.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/98ed3cfc36b50795fcce96cdc37e14d5.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/eab52b8d1260287964dddad5c8cc4130.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/eab52b8d1260287964dddad5c8cc4130.webm?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/eab52b8d1260287964dddad5c8cc4130.mp4?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No overcomplicated effects. No special rules. Just you and your opponent, a stack of cards with easily understandable effects, and an endless variety of tactics to use. What matters is your choice here and now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/c6b7b9d4e35265385a665887321e489c.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/e38a706949025de7efccdb78cb5891d7.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/e38a706949025de7efccdb78cb5891d7.webm?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/e38a706949025de7efccdb78cb5891d7.mp4?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mechanics are balanced to ensure fast paced matches that aren't decided in the first ten seconds by luck of the draw. You can always make a comeback with the next hand if you play the cards right, even if you're up against the wall. Worried about stalling? A set turn limit ensures each game wraps up quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/13c661bf0de100213e16139a6583afeb.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/ca4dbe9ddb9e18663c5858109f902254.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/ca4dbe9ddb9e18663c5858109f902254.webm?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/ca4dbe9ddb9e18663c5858109f902254.mp4?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don't lose a battle to random chance or the opponent having a one-in-a-million combination of exotic effects. It's all about your choices in each match, making every win and every loss understandable. Once you understand the core mechanics with a few quick matches, it's all down to skill! Even when you\u2019re losing, there\u2019s always an opportunity to strike back and win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da063534163f1826c7ffae8c.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da063534163f1826c7ffae8c.webm?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da063534163f1826c7ffae8c.mp4?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ELEMENTALIST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/8da4c6a85e6901ab8ecd02455e846d1acf7d71c4.jpg"},{"name":"BEGINNER'S LUCK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/5b1b8651a836d34814bfad73ea7f6585682d60df.jpg"},{"name":"PLANO SUMMONER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/8167a950a2871c7b74be056f5411e1f2dc4416f5.jpg"},{"name":"VETERAN VICTORIES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/4402d8649730f3a3bb4d3b0141daa53b9fae8ba8.jpg"},{"name":"WEALTH ACCUMULATOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/14aaed41b4fa6bcd2826ea055bf9c11a4bec6c89.jpg"},{"name":"BLUE GATHERER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/5085c3984d85c30ae31bb9e63bf82cef9e3832bd.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL ACHIEVER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/26e6787e43542d52c4400f4fcb05dcd053ae82c3.jpg"},{"name":"SEASONED PLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/c00eae3d79a0695e2d420020c314d988f95e1f01.jpg"},{"name":"ELEMENTAL CHAMPION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/a27756c63c710307fae6fc9fd3c67f64d1919d1e.jpg"},{"name":"ASTRAL MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1896570/280495d285210fa3dc24cf6880013a0b984ae62c.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1896570?t=1767980373","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767980373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/36afb59ee979789880719fa97f6ee861b3aa0b4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767980373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/36afb59ee979789880719fa97f6ee861b3aa0b4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767980373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/4ab13e5e30cea0dfdabab0dc21254a28.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span>Final Stardust is a return to basics for Collectible Card Games! It's built around fast-paced, five minute battles thanks to streamlined, easily understandable gameplay. Thanks to instant effects and positioning your monsters - or Planos - it's all about how you play the hand you draw, rather than mastery of meta and min-maxing your deck.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/98ed3cfc36b50795fcce96cdc37e14d5.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/eab52b8d1260287964dddad5c8cc4130.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/eab52b8d1260287964dddad5c8cc4130.webm?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/eab52b8d1260287964dddad5c8cc4130.mp4?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No overcomplicated effects. No special rules. Just you and your opponent, a stack of cards with easily understandable effects, and an endless variety of tactics to use. What matters is your choice here and now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/c6b7b9d4e35265385a665887321e489c.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/e38a706949025de7efccdb78cb5891d7.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/e38a706949025de7efccdb78cb5891d7.webm?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/e38a706949025de7efccdb78cb5891d7.mp4?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mechanics are balanced to ensure fast paced matches that aren't decided in the first ten seconds by luck of the draw. You can always make a comeback with the next hand if you play the cards right, even if you're up against the wall. Worried about stalling? A set turn limit ensures each game wraps up quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/13c661bf0de100213e16139a6583afeb.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/ca4dbe9ddb9e18663c5858109f902254.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/ca4dbe9ddb9e18663c5858109f902254.webm?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/ca4dbe9ddb9e18663c5858109f902254.mp4?t=1767980373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don't lose a battle to random chance or the opponent having a one-in-a-million combination of exotic effects. It's all about your choices in each match, making every win and every loss understandable. Once you understand the core mechanics with a few quick matches, it's all down to skill! Even when you\u2019re losing, there\u2019s always an opportunity to strike back and win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da063534163f1826c7ffae8c.poster.avif?t=1767980373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da